WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.600
Saved that X thread to read later?

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.000
Too late. It's gone.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.000
Endless scrolling. Messy screenshots.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.000
Lost bookmarks. No offline copy.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.000
There's a better way.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.000
Meet Xtracticle.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.000
Paste any X article, thread or post link.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.000
Hit Extract, then download. Done.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.000
Even faster: just edit the link.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.000
Change x.com to xtracticle.com and hit Enter.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.000
Save it as PDF, Markdown, EPUB or plain text…

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:25.000
…or a ZIP with every image. Offline, forever.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.000
Full threads from any post. 20 links at once.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.000
Free, open source, no login.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:33.600
Xtracticle.com — keep what you read on X.
